    "body": "### What is the problem?\r\n\r\nDirectly from Violentmonkey's privacy policy: \"We may use Google Analytics to collect your browser information anonymously to help improve compatibility.\"\r\n\r\nWhy..? This is unneeded. It would be a good decision to remove this, or make it an opt-in only feature, disabled by default. This is a privacy concern. I've come across many users switching off violentmonkey simply due to this. It doesn't matter if it's anonymously collected, this is what people don't want. They don't want their data collected like this. Please, I highly encourage you to remove this.\r\n\r\nScreenshot: https://b.catgirlsare.sexy/cTV7.png\r\n\r\n### How to reproduce it?\r\n1. View Privacy Policy",
